# Node: direct closed calculation; exact fraction rounding
# Before (rejected by the baseline release):
# floor(-7/3)=-3
# Former behavior: JSON success=false and process exit 1.
# Now: the same assertion and its exact eval are supported.
# Boundary: false results and ill-defined inputs still reject; see
# examples/negative/closed_exact_elementary_calculation/.
# Run: target/release/litex -strict -f examples/proof_nodes/equal/by_builtin_rule/closed_fraction_rounding_calculation.lit

floor(-7/3)=-3
ceil(-7/3)=-2
floor(7/3)=2
ceil(7/3)=3
floor(-6/3)=-2
ceil(-6/3)=-2
sign(1/3-1/2)=-1
sign(1/3-2/6)=0
gcd((1/3)*6,8)=2
lcm((1/3)*6,8)=8
quot((1/3)*(-21),3)=-3
((1/3)*(-21))%3=2
factorial((1/3)*9)=6
eval floor(-7/3)
eval ceil(-7/3)
eval gcd((1/3)*6,8)
